@startuml Flujo_Reporte_PDF
!theme plain
autonumber
title CU-05: Consulta y Compilación de Reporte Clínico PDF

actor Terapeuta
participant "App Terapeuta" as AppT
actor Paciente
participant "App Paciente" as AppP
participant "Backend\nFastAPI" as Backend
database "Cloud SQL" as DB
participant "ReportLab" as ReportLab

Terapeuta -> AppT: Solicita reporte\n(paciente + rango fechas)
AppT -> Backend: POST /api/v1/consent/request
Backend -> DB: INSERT INTO consent_requests\n(status='pending')
Backend -> AppP: FCM Push\n"Nueva solicitud de reporte"

Paciente -> AppP: Abre "Solicitudes"
AppP -> Backend: GET /api/v1/consent/requests
Backend --> AppP: Lista de solicitudes
Paciente -> AppP: Presiona "Aceptar"

AppP -> Backend: POST /api/v1/consent/respond/{id}\n{ accept: true }
Backend -> DB: UPDATE status='accepted'

Backend -> DB: SELECT * FROM diary_entries\nWHERE period BETWEEN ...
DB --> Backend: Lista de registros
Backend -> ReportLab: generate_pdf(report_data)
ReportLab --> Backend: PDF bytes
Backend -> Backend: Guarda PDF en /reports/
Backend -> AppT: FCM Push\n"Reporte listo para descargar"

Terapeuta -> AppT: Presiona "Descargar PDF"
AppT -> Backend: GET /api/v1/therapist/download-report/{id}
Backend --> AppT: application/pdf
AppT -> Terapeuta: Compartir / Guardar PDF

@enduml